  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Resolved the current-main conflict in 6301e82589. Merged current main (7c99ace127), keeping its wait_timeout/reaping behavior and all 4 upstream process tests. Moved the parent-exit regression into the current unittest file. Remote Linux/Python 3.12 with psutil 7.2.2 passes all 5 tests; current-main production code raises NoSuchProcess in the new regression. isort 7.0.0, Ruff 0.15.1 checks/format and git diff --check pass. No full multimodal or accelerator suite is claimed.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-16T13:12:12Z",
